# Visual consistency

Use the frozen style in `channel/config.py` for the selected mode. Do not rewrite it per scene.

WTRT = muted historical flat 2D. Money = clean analytical business 2D. Takeover = energetic strategic 2D.

Not photoreal, not 3D, not anime. Historical names and company names stay out of image prompts (`channel/prompts.py`).

Never put a company or person name in a GenerateImage **filename** — the model will paint the word onto the picture. Use the job’s `generate_filename` (hashed token), then copy onto `filename` / `copy_to`.

Named public figures must be a recognizable cartoon of the real person. Reuse `channel/character_locks.json` and pass the hashed photo plus sheet in `channel/character_sheets/` as GenerateImage references.

Every still: one idea, one oversized focal object, named lighting, unique staging (`docs/video-engine/QUALITY_BAR.md` / `channel/quality_bar.py`). No filing-table wallpaper.

Stills ~4–8 seconds. Long output 3840×2160. Shorts 1080×1920.
